# CMake/CANN build output directories.
**/build/
**/build-*/
**/build_out/
**/build-out/
**/cmake-build-*/

# Python bytecode and caches.
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Generated operator UT inputs, outputs, and simulator diagnostics.
**/tests/ut/op_kernel/*_data/*.bin
**/tests/ut/op_kernel/*_data/cceprint/
**/tests/ut/op_kernel/*_data/npuchk/
**/tests/ut/op_kernel/*_data/stub_reg.log
